### 7.4 Loop interruption posture (v1)

This prompt was produced under v1's loop posture: an interrupted
iteration is discarded and re-run. There is no mid-iteration
resumption (DESIGN.md §7.1 non-goals). Long loops may have been
re-run from the prior iteration's output if the user interrupted.
This does not affect score validity but is recorded for
traceability.

